WEBVTT

00:31.860 --> 00:34.070
<b>Damnit, there's no end to them!</b>

00:34.070 --> 00:36.910
<b>We won't make it
at this point, Guildmaster!</b>

00:36.910 --> 00:39.230
<b>Hold them back no matter what!</b>

00:39.870 --> 00:41.660
<b>Protect Omui</b>

00:41.660 --> 00:44.670
<b>That is the duty of every member
of the adventurer's guild!</b>

00:50.140 --> 00:53.670
<b>But we're at our limits...</b>

00:54.760 --> 00:59.680
<b>Even the daughter of the local lord
braved danger and went to the dungeon...</b>

01:05.060 --> 01:07.690
<b>Those new adventurer kids...</b>

01:08.180 --> 01:09.940
<b>If we can get them to help us...</b>

01:11.690 --> 01:14.740
<b>Then we can definitely
get through this crisis!</b>

01:14.740 --> 01:17.200
<b>Hold fast and believe in them!</b>

01:17.200 --> 01:19.530
<b>The Guildmaster might be right...</b>

01:20.000 --> 01:24.790
<b>As their seniors,
we can't be weak in this time of need!</b>

01:32.500 --> 01:36.010
<b>Here they come!
Don't let a single one pass!</b>

01:41.760 --> 01:44.430
<b>♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪</b>

01:44.430 --> 01:45.430
<b>♪Good Luck♪</b>

01:46.500 --> 01:55.760
<b>Loner Life in Another World</b>

01:46.500 --> 01:55.760
<b>Loner Life in Another World</b>

01:56.570 --> 01:59.240
<b>♪Shutting in my room
Makes me invincible on Mondays♪</b>

01:59.240 --> 02:01.620
<b>♪A single step outside
And it's trouble all over the place♪</b>

02:01.620 --> 02:04.290
<b>♪Someone fires a flare signaling a mayday♪</b>

02:04.290 --> 02:06.620
<b>♪I wish I could pretend I didn't hear it♪</b>

02:06.710 --> 02:09.120
<b>♪Enough with fair fights♪</b>

02:09.120 --> 02:11.630
<b>♪First come first serve is an illusion♪</b>

02:11.630 --> 02:13.880
<b>♪Leave everything to the dice♪</b>

02:13.880 --> 02:16.130
<b>♪But I'm bad with my rolls♪</b>

02:16.720 --> 02:19.220
<b>♪See, it may not be a clean cut♪</b>

02:19.220 --> 02:21.760
<b>♪But surprisingly
You're not just some leftover♪</b>

02:21.760 --> 02:24.220
<b>♪They have something that I don't?♪</b>

02:24.220 --> 02:27.520
<b>♪That's nonsense, I won't greed over that♪</b>

02:28.270 --> 02:31.440
<b>♪People decide who's a loner
And who is worthless♪</b>

02:31.440 --> 02:34.110
<b>♪Hold it right there young boy
You have some free time, right?♪</b>

02:34.110 --> 02:36.150
<b>♪Don't you just hate crowds?♪</b>

02:36.150 --> 02:39.110
<b>♪If you're bored, why not try a gamble?♪</b>

02:39.110 --> 02:41.990
<b>♪Manage the botches and luck then dance♪</b>

02:41.990 --> 02:44.620
<b>♪Not really into failing and falling♪</b>

02:44.620 --> 02:47.120
<b>♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪</b>

02:47.120 --> 02:50.040
<b>♪Doesn't cheating count as a skill?♪</b>

03:00.510 --> 03:07.890
<b>♪Good Luck lies in odd numbers♪</b>

03:07.890 --> 03:08.980
<b>♪Good Luck♪</b>

03:13.210 --> 03:17.210
<b>\hEpisode 11  Escape from the Dungeon\h</b>

03:18.850 --> 03:20.910
<b>I'll definitely stop the stampede.</b>

03:21.380 --> 03:24.120
<b>I'll keep making my way up!</b>

03:24.120 --> 03:28.910
<b>Okay! We'll do our best to meet up
with you as soon as possible!</b>

03:28.910 --> 03:33.130
<b>Please hurry!
Omui's fate is in your hands!</b>

03:33.130 --> 03:34.350
<b>Gotcha!</b>

03:36.910 --> 03:38.630
<b>All right, let's do this.</b>

03:38.630 --> 03:43.760
<b>Hey, the fire's getting stronger.
Do you mind if we speed things up?</b>

03:47.870 --> 03:50.370
<b>73rd floor</b>

03:47.890 --> 03:49.870
<b>Hurry! We will save everyone!</b>

03:54.730 --> 03:56.980
<b>Reptilian monsters are weak to cold!</b>

04:03.010 --> 04:09.020
<b>72nd floor</b>

04:03.570 --> 04:06.030
<b>I'll use smoke
to fumigate insect monsters!</b>

04:12.270 --> 04:14.520
<b>70th floor</b>

04:15.280 --> 04:17.980
<b>It's pretty fast, but it's just a dog!</b>

04:18.780 --> 04:20.570
<b>I'll block its sense of smell!</b>

04:21.590 --> 04:25.680
<b>Have a taste of the seasoning vinegar
I bought from the general store!</b>

04:27.430 --> 04:30.180
<b>After that, the Knight Rep
will take care of the rest!</b>

04:45.090 --> 04:47.370
<b>Better be quick
at sorting all these loots.</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Duality Gauntlets:</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Left: Nullifies physical and magic attacks</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Right: Nullifies physical and magic immunities</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Mutabeast Bracer</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Boosts all stats</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Trap Ring:</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Disables all traps</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Magic Key (Lv. MAX):</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Can be used in place of</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>any key below MAX level</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Elder Treant Wand:</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Magic finesse & magic power +50%.</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:52.480
<b>Stats boost (Major)</b>

04:48.070 --> 04:52.060
<b>Let's fuse the ones that would
help me clear dungeons.</b>

04:52.500 --> 04:56.000
<b>I haven't found the Pheromone Ring
I was looking for either.</b>

04:57.030 --> 04:59.570
<b>But these items should be good.</b>

05:01.440 --> 05:04.250
<b>Oh, you're wondering
what I'll do with these?</b>

05:04.260 --> 05:07.510
<b>Well, there's something I'd like to try
when we get back to town.</b>

05:14.840 --> 05:17.380
<b>Hmm? You're wondering
if I should take a break?</b>

05:20.070 --> 05:22.570
<b>I know that I'm pushing myself.</b>

05:24.650 --> 05:25.680
<b>But...</b>

05:28.420 --> 05:30.420
<b>I can't stop here.</b>

05:35.140 --> 05:39.150
<b>69th floor</b>

05:37.050 --> 05:40.130
<b>We're in a new area from here on.
It's the forest stage.</b>

05:43.900 --> 05:48.780
<b>Mesmer Owl</b>

05:44.120 --> 05:48.620
<b>An owl? Judging by its name,
it can probably hypnotize people to sleep.</b>

05:56.440 --> 05:57.630
<b>Too bad.</b>

05:57.640 --> 05:59.870
<b>I have General Health skill,</b>

05:59.880 --> 06:01.460
<b>so status effects...</b>

06:01.460 --> 06:04.160
<b>won't... work...</b>

06:04.160 --> 06:07.200
<b>Wait, why do I feel sleepy...?</b>

06:08.760 --> 06:14.600
<b>I see. I was so at my limit,
my skills didn't even activate...</b>

06:24.580 --> 06:26.950
<b>You pushed on ahead?</b>

06:27.880 --> 06:31.090
<b>Sorry about that.
You were even worried about me.</b>

06:33.560 --> 06:37.640
<b>What? You'll carry on
so I should rest more?</b>

06:42.100 --> 06:44.930
<b>Okay, a little bit more, then...</b>

06:51.030 --> 06:52.740
<b>What the...</b>

06:52.740 --> 06:54.120
<b>What's with this monster...?</b>

06:54.770 --> 06:56.400
<b>It's too strong!</b>

06:57.180 --> 06:59.440
<b>Sphinx Lv 100</b>

07:03.560 --> 07:07.820
<b>We were so close to meeting Haruka...
Why did this have to show up now...?</b>

07:19.980 --> 07:23.480
<b>No good! It's not working
no matter how hard I swing!</b>

07:31.110 --> 07:33.410
<b>M-my magic isn't working either!</b>

07:33.410 --> 07:38.120
<b>E-even if it worked,
I don't think we can win either...</b>

07:38.120 --> 07:40.100
<b>Why is that?</b>

07:40.610 --> 07:44.240
<b>The Sphinx of the dungeon
is a monster that asks riddles...</b>

07:44.240 --> 07:47.020
<b>It's not something
you're supposed to fight.</b>

07:47.020 --> 07:50.420
<b>Even some adventurers say
that it's immortal.</b>

07:50.420 --> 07:52.800
<b>B-by immortal, you mean...</b>

07:52.800 --> 07:55.430
<b>It won't die no matter what?</b>

07:55.430 --> 07:58.560
<b>H-how are we supposed to fight
something like that?</b>

08:05.540 --> 08:08.420
<b>59th floor</b>

08:07.360 --> 08:10.830
<b>Thanks, uh... Angelica?</b>

08:10.830 --> 08:13.040
<b>I've gotten a lot better thanks to you.</b>

08:16.880 --> 08:18.280
<b>Whoa.</b>

08:18.290 --> 08:20.660
<b>How old is this dungeon again?</b>

08:20.660 --> 08:24.920
<b>There's no telling when the floor
would collapse. I better be careful.</b>

08:25.020 --> 08:26.310
<b>Presence Detection</b>

08:26.920 --> 08:28.610
<b>This presence...</b>

08:37.040 --> 08:42.300
<b>U-until now, we could beat any opponent
as long as we worked together...</b>

08:43.180 --> 08:46.060
<b>But this one is impervious to both
physical and magical attacks...</b>

08:46.630 --> 08:48.680
<b>And not to mention immortal...</b>

08:52.610 --> 08:55.450
<b>We can't win against this!</b>

08:57.840 --> 09:01.450
<b>We can't fight anymore...</b>

09:05.830 --> 09:07.580
<b>C-Class Rep!</b>

09:19.030 --> 09:24.850
<b>With the effect of the Duality Gauntlets
that I fused to my gloves,</b>

09:24.850 --> 09:27.350
<b>I'll nullify its physical immunity!</b>

09:25.830 --> 09:28.330
<b>Duality Gauntlets</b>

09:25.830 --> 09:28.330
<b>Left: Nullifies physical and magic attacks</b>

09:25.830 --> 09:28.330
<b>Right: Nullifies physical and magic immunities</b>

09:34.330 --> 09:38.510
<b>You may be level 100, but you're
just a mid-boss on the 57th floor.</b>

09:40.270 --> 09:45.150
<b>Bow down before Angelica,
the true boss of the dungeon!</b>

10:13.570 --> 10:17.030
<b>Uh, I'm back, I guess?</b>

10:19.110 --> 10:20.740
<b>Welcome back.</b>

10:21.490 --> 10:23.190
<b>What took you so long?</b>

10:23.190 --> 10:26.040
<b>Everyone was waiting
for you, you know?</b>

10:26.040 --> 10:28.000
<b>That's right, Haruka.</b>

10:28.000 --> 10:29.500
<b>You're so late.</b>

10:29.500 --> 10:31.670
<b>You sure know
how to make trouble for others!</b>

10:31.670 --> 10:33.290
<b>You can say that again.</b>

10:33.290 --> 10:35.210
<b>But thankfully you seem okay.</b>

10:35.210 --> 10:36.550
<b>Yeah, true.</b>

10:36.550 --> 10:38.720
<b>You're finally back!</b>

10:38.720 --> 10:41.050
<b>And, uh... Who is that knight?</b>

10:41.050 --> 10:43.810
<b>Oh, this person is...</b>

10:47.430 --> 10:48.810
<b>Haruka!</b>

10:48.810 --> 10:50.850
<b>I knew it would crumble!</b>

10:52.710 --> 10:55.440
<b>Phew, good thing
I was looking out for that.</b>

10:55.440 --> 10:57.860
<b>Jeez, you scared me.</b>

10:57.860 --> 11:00.450
<b>Don't make us worry like that.</b>

11:00.450 --> 11:02.070
<b>It's okay.</b>

11:02.070 --> 11:06.080
<b>I have all kinds of skills
that can look out for that now.</b>

11:07.700 --> 11:08.910
<b>Seriously...?</b>

11:08.910 --> 11:13.030
<b>N-not even I can detect that!</b>

11:15.080 --> 11:16.300
<b>This time...</b>

11:21.940 --> 11:23.450
<b>I will catch him this time!</b>

11:27.390 --> 11:31.900
<b>I'll catch you and won't ever let go!</b>

11:33.360 --> 11:35.340
<b>That would be a problem.</b>

11:35.340 --> 11:37.720
<b>Now I can't get away from you anymore.</b>

11:44.160 --> 11:45.700
<b>Good job, Class Rep!</b>

11:45.700 --> 11:47.640
<b>We did it!</b>

11:47.640 --> 11:51.410
<b>Whoa, there are so many people here!
This is hard for a loner like me!</b>

11:51.420 --> 11:54.580
<b>We can't celebrate just yet.</b>

11:54.590 --> 11:57.170
<b>- Nerd?
- Look down there.</b>

12:03.430 --> 12:05.930
<b>The third wave of the stampede?!</b>

12:05.930 --> 12:10.550
<b>If all those monsters get out,
there won't be anything left of Omui...</b>

12:10.550 --> 12:12.160
<b>W-what are we going to do?!</b>

12:12.160 --> 12:13.900
<b>We have to stop them!</b>

12:13.900 --> 12:15.650
<b>But how?!</b>

12:15.650 --> 12:19.440
<b>Haruka, you said you have a plan
to save the town, right?</b>

12:23.380 --> 12:26.560
<b>She is the key to achieving that.</b>

12:27.700 --> 12:30.580
<b>She? Just who is her?</b>

12:30.580 --> 12:35.690
<b>E-everyone, let's hurry back to Omui!
The town is in grave danger!</b>

12:36.210 --> 12:40.000
<b>Head back to the surface at once!
Use the warpgate!</b>

12:40.010 --> 12:43.130
<b>What?! I never found anything like that!</b>

12:43.140 --> 12:47.060
<b>Because nobody else travels up
the dungeon from the bottom!</b>

12:47.060 --> 12:48.220
<b>Quickly!</b>

12:48.220 --> 12:49.460
<b>All right...</b>

12:53.730 --> 12:58.770
<b>Hey, how can you beat
the strong monster on the bottom levels?</b>

13:00.540 --> 13:03.880
<b>Had I used normal tactics,
I couldn't have won. But...</b>

13:04.740 --> 13:05.970
<b>But?</b>

13:06.490 --> 13:10.990
<b>In this world, I have a chance of winning
if I can come up with a trick.</b>

13:18.750 --> 13:20.190
<b>Old man!</b>

13:20.190 --> 13:21.500
<b>You guys!</b>

13:21.500 --> 13:23.170
<b>You're all right?</b>

13:23.170 --> 13:25.090
<b>Is anybody hurt?</b>

13:25.090 --> 13:26.970
<b>We're hanging on, somehow.</b>

13:26.970 --> 13:28.430
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

13:28.430 --> 13:31.510
<b>Same goes for you,
good to see you well.</b>

13:31.760 --> 13:35.020
<b>W-we can talk later!
The monsters are coming!</b>

14:15.020 --> 14:19.020
<b>S-so this is the true stampede?!</b>

14:20.610 --> 14:22.650
<b>No way...</b>

14:22.650 --> 14:24.480
<b>You got to be kidding...</b>

14:24.490 --> 14:26.700
<b>It's on a whole different scale!</b>

14:32.780 --> 14:34.450
<b>E-everything will be all right!</b>

14:34.450 --> 14:38.330
<b>The adventurers of Omui
will defeat the monsters!</b>

14:42.340 --> 14:45.090
<b>W-what are we supposed
to do against this?</b>

14:45.090 --> 14:50.090
<b>There's no way we can win
against this, right...?</b>

14:50.090 --> 14:53.600
<b>O-our town...</b>

15:17.720 --> 15:19.310
<b>Knight Rep...</b>

15:20.000 --> 15:23.500
<b>No, Angelica, you're up!</b>

15:34.510 --> 15:38.520
<b>She has defeated all kinds
of monsters in the dungeon.</b>

15:42.020 --> 15:46.070
<b>Her power dominates
every monster in there.</b>

15:47.020 --> 15:50.950
<b>There is no mistaking it,
she rules over them all.</b>

15:52.110 --> 15:55.200
<b>If she is the ruler of that dungeon...</b>

15:57.990 --> 16:03.040
<b>Then she should be able to make
all the monsters of the dungeon disappear!</b>

16:23.040 --> 16:26.060
<b>T-the monsters vanished...?</b>

16:52.040 --> 16:53.750
<b>It went just as planned.</b>

16:54.510 --> 16:58.640
<b>W-what's going on?
Why did all those monsters just vanish?</b>

16:58.640 --> 17:01.020
<b>Is that your power, Haruka?</b>

17:01.020 --> 17:06.260
<b>Nah, I didn't do anything.
It's all thanks to Angelica.</b>

17:06.260 --> 17:07.560
<b>Or so I guess.</b>

17:09.300 --> 17:13.260
<b>Wait, is that person
the Dungeon Emperor?</b>

17:13.260 --> 17:15.340
<b>- What?!
- Dungeon Emperor?!</b>

17:15.340 --> 17:17.490
<b>So she's a monster?</b>

17:18.000 --> 17:21.880
<b>Oh, it's all right.
She's not dangerous at all.</b>

17:21.880 --> 17:25.870
<b>We explored the dungeon together,
and she saved me many times.</b>

17:25.880 --> 17:26.690
<b>Right?</b>

17:27.920 --> 17:30.440
<b>Well, if you say so...</b>

17:30.440 --> 17:32.610
<b>I guess I shouldn't worry then, but...</b>

17:33.210 --> 17:35.420
<b>But if she's the Dungeon Emperor...</b>

17:35.490 --> 17:39.740
<b>Dungeon Emperor</b>

17:35.490 --> 17:39.740
<b>Dungeon Boss</b>

17:35.490 --> 17:39.740
<b>Floor Master</b>

17:35.490 --> 17:38.530
<b>Monsters</b>

17:40.390 --> 17:44.520
<b>It's strong enough to control all
the monsters inside the dungeon, isn't it?</b>

17:44.810 --> 17:49.310
<b>I knew you nerds know
unnecessarily way too much.</b>

17:49.310 --> 17:52.320
<b>O-oh, that's not true...</b>

17:52.320 --> 17:53.970
<b>Hey, that's not a compliment.</b>

17:53.970 --> 17:55.030
<b>Huh?</b>

17:55.030 --> 17:59.030
<b>It's true, Angelica is the strongest
being in the dungeon.</b>

17:59.740 --> 18:02.870
<b>Some things happened
and her level went down to one,</b>

18:00.220 --> 18:01.220
<b>Servitude</b>

18:01.220 --> 18:02.850
<b>Angelica</b>

18:01.220 --> 18:02.850
<b>Race: Skeleton?</b>

18:02.870 --> 18:06.590
<b>but she can still kill any monster in
an instant with her overwhelming power.</b>

18:07.640 --> 18:12.240
<b>I thought that she could make
any monster obey her with that power.</b>

18:13.210 --> 18:17.790
<b>Though, that power only works
on the monsters inside the dungeon,</b>

18:17.790 --> 18:21.080
<b>and we had to get close to
the monsters that got outside.</b>

18:21.500 --> 18:22.440
<b>Isn't that right?</b>

18:24.220 --> 18:27.480
<b>By the way, what happened
to the monsters that disappeared?</b>

18:27.480 --> 18:30.130
<b>They're not rampaging
somewhere else, right?</b>

18:30.520 --> 18:32.840
<b>Well, right now...</b>

18:33.140 --> 18:36.090
<b>They should be social-distancing
in their home at the dungeon.</b>

18:36.570 --> 18:38.300
<b>What?!</b>

18:39.050 --> 18:41.970
<b>It's an order from
the Dungeon Emperor, after all.</b>

18:42.330 --> 18:44.290
<b>They're obeying her like good kids.</b>

18:44.290 --> 18:47.040
<b>Then that means Omui is...</b>

18:47.410 --> 18:49.790
<b>Yeah, the town is safe now.</b>

18:54.060 --> 18:56.900
<b>We did it!</b>

18:58.100 --> 19:01.810
<b>I'm really glad I could save Angelica.</b>

19:09.040 --> 19:12.960
<b>The town of Omui should be
in peace for a while as well.</b>

19:17.820 --> 19:21.820
<b>All right, time to do the little party
that I thought of back in the dungeon.</b>

19:27.830 --> 19:29.960
<b>This, and this...</b>

19:29.960 --> 19:32.040
<b>Oh, this one should be good as well!</b>

19:32.040 --> 19:34.720
<b>Umm, what are you doing?</b>

19:35.640 --> 19:40.810
<b>I was thinking of using the items I got
from the dungeon for a little party.</b>

19:51.700 --> 19:55.610
<b>Haruka, I brought everyone as you asked.</b>

19:55.610 --> 19:56.690
<b>Oh, thanks.</b>

19:56.690 --> 19:58.480
<b>- What?
- What is it?</b>

19:58.480 --> 20:00.240
<b>We already had breakfast.</b>

20:03.160 --> 20:06.120
<b>Wow, this is amazing!</b>

20:06.120 --> 20:09.080
<b>What's with this pile of treasure?!</b>

20:09.080 --> 20:13.120
<b>All of them are pretty rare gears!</b>

20:17.860 --> 20:21.130
<b>All right, everyone!
Are you ready for a shopping spree?!</b>

20:21.170 --> 20:23.720
<b>Wait, you're selling these?!</b>

20:23.720 --> 20:26.140
<b>On a huge discount!
It's first come first serve!</b>

20:26.800 --> 20:27.720
<b>Yay!</b>

20:27.720 --> 20:30.020
<b>My body moves on its own
when I hear that!</b>

20:30.020 --> 20:34.520
<b>So this is a race, huh?
We won't let those girls beat us!</b>

20:34.520 --> 20:35.520
<b>Yeah!</b>

20:35.520 --> 20:39.780
<b>Now then, the dungeon gear
scramble sale...</b>

20:39.780 --> 20:41.360
<b>...begins now!</b>

20:43.280 --> 20:45.440
<b>Oh, I forgot to mention one thing.</b>

20:45.440 --> 20:48.530
<b>Make sure you have the money
to pay for it, okay?</b>

20:48.530 --> 20:50.790
<b>Uh, they're not listening.</b>

20:54.800 --> 20:56.160
<b>This is mine!</b>

20:56.160 --> 20:57.670
<b>No, it's mine!</b>

21:01.420 --> 21:03.420
<b>Everyone's going crazy...</b>

21:03.430 --> 21:06.680
<b>Not to mention,
since I said this is a sale...</b>

21:07.050 --> 21:11.680
<b>The girls turned into demons,
and not just that, raging demons!</b>

21:11.680 --> 21:15.020
<b>Hopefully the boys won't lose...
Hey, they already lost the will to fight!</b>

21:16.910 --> 21:18.660
<b>Oh well...</b>

21:19.060 --> 21:21.720
<b>I guess I'll give them
the ones I set aside.</b>

21:22.570 --> 21:24.990
<b>You're a true friend!</b>

21:24.990 --> 21:27.570
<b>Hey, I'm not the treasure here!</b>

21:28.530 --> 21:31.450
<b>- That weapon looks nice.
- This one is amazing as well!</b>

21:31.450 --> 21:33.190
<b>Boys, let me try that!</b>

21:33.620 --> 21:37.460
<b>All right, that should make
their lives a little easier.</b>

21:37.460 --> 21:42.090
<b>But I'm still worried
about one thing, Angelica.</b>

21:43.450 --> 21:46.530
<b>She'll be staying with us
in the town for now.</b>

21:47.480 --> 21:51.560
<b>But she's been all alone
in that dungeon for a long time.</b>

21:52.790 --> 21:54.810
<b>I know I'm not
in any position to say this,</b>

21:54.810 --> 21:57.590
<b>but she probably has
zero communication skills.</b>

21:58.020 --> 22:02.860
<b>Will she be able
to get along with everyone?</b>

22:17.790 --> 22:22.380
<b>♪The sunset I saw on my own was beautiful♪</b>

22:22.380 --> 22:27.590
<b>♪I ended the day
Without having anyone to talk about it♪</b>

22:27.590 --> 22:32.220
<b>♪I care not for the loneliness and moved on♪</b>

22:32.220 --> 22:37.390
<b>♪One thing after another
New stuff keeps appearing before me♪</b>

22:37.390 --> 22:42.020
<b>♪I went through so many things
Yet I can't imagine how it will go♪</b>

22:42.020 --> 22:44.690
<b>♪How silly I am♪</b>

22:44.690 --> 22:49.320
<b>♪They might look bland
Yet that's not always the case♪</b>

22:49.320 --> 22:54.330
<b>♪They toy with the careless me
Who still hasn't learned my lesson♪</b>

22:54.330 --> 22:59.040
<b>♪As always, we're all loners♪</b>

22:59.040 --> 23:03.960
<b>♪Each time we pass by
We say our hellos and goodbyes♪</b>

23:03.960 --> 23:08.840
<b>♪I care not
I simply want to play for today♪</b>

23:08.840 --> 23:13.970
<b>♪Having a little fun
Before saying good night♪</b>

23:16.640 --> 23:22.940
<b>♪I hum as I think of the next time
We meet again♪</b>

23:26.400 --> 23:32.700
<b>♪I hum on in the middle of
My lonely journey♪</b>
